{"id":"H0511","lemma":"אֶלְקָנָה","transliteration":"elqanah","sayIt":"EL-qa-nah","language":"Hebrew","partOfSpeech":"","gloss":"Elkanah","meaning":"A man of the tribe of Levi living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Exo.6.24;\nson of: Korah (H7141I);\nbrother of: Assir (H0617) and Ebiasaph (H0043)\n§ Elkanah = \"God has possessed\" or \"God has created\"\n1) Samuel's father\n2) a ruler in Jerusalem in the time of king Ahaz\n3) one of David's mighty warriors\n4) son of Korah\n5) several Levites","glosses":["elkanah","then elkanah"],"count":20,"occurrences":[{"chapterId":"exo-6","v":24,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elkanah","kjv":"and Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-1","v":1,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elkanah","kjv":"was Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-1","v":4,"renderings":{"bsb":"for Elkanah","kjv":"was that Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-1","v":8,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elkanah","kjv":"Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-1","v":19,"renderings":{"bsb":"And Elkanah","kjv":"nd Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-1","v":21,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Elkanah","kjv":"Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-1","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elkanah","kjv":"And Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-2","v":11,"renderings":{"bsb":"Then Elkanah","kjv":"And Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1sa-2","v":20,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elkanah","kjv":"Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":23,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elkanah","kjv":"Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":25,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Elkanah","kjv":"of Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":26,"renderings":{"bsb":"Elkanah","kjv":"As for Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":27,"renderings":{"bsb":"and Elkanah","kjv":"Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":34,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Elkanah","kjv":"of Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":35,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Elkanah","kjv":"of Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-6","v":36,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Elkanah","kjv":"of Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-9","v":16,"renderings":{"bsb":"of Elkanah","kjv":"of Elkanah"}},{"chapterId":"1ch-12","v":6,"rendering